---
description: Preserve the user's sole authorship on every commit
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commit authorship

- Never add `Co-authored-by` or any other authorship trailer naming Cursor, an AI agent, or the assistant.
- Before pushing a commit created or amended by the agent, inspect its full message with `git log -1 --format=full`.
- If an automated hook adds an unwanted trailer, remove it before pushing.
- Keep the repository-configured user as the sole author and committer unless the user explicitly requests otherwise.
